# Cipher (CR 702.99): Bot1 encodes Trait Doctoring on Llanowar Elves as it resolves, and the card stays in exile. When
# the Elves deal combat damage to Bot2, their controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana
# cost: the copy makes Bot2's Island a Swamp until end of turn and ceases to exist (CR 707.10), and the card is still
# encoded. The next time the Elves connect, Bot1 declines.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island
Trait Doctoring
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Trait Doctoring.Cast(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a color word)
Bot1.Colors(Green)
Bot1.Colors(Blue)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
? Exile = Trait Doctoring
? Bot1.Graveyard =
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.CombatDamage]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a basic land type)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Swamp
? Exile = Trait Doctoring
? Bot1.Graveyard =
? Stack.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Island
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.CombatDamage]
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot2.Life = 18
Exile = Trait Doctoring
Bot1.Graveyard =
